## Задание 2. Проектирование API

### Shop Partner API

**Описание:** позволяет вывести список магазинов-партнеров. По умолчанию считается, что пользователь уже авторизовался в системе.

#### Request

**Method:** GET </br>
**URL:** /api/partner-shops?city={city}</br>
**Content-type:** application/json</br>

**Request parameters:**

| Name | Type | Description | Mandatory |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| city | string | City, specified by user at the registration. | yes |

**Request URL Example:**
```
https://domain.tld/api/partner-shops?city=Moscow
```

#### Success Response

**Success response parameters:**
| Name | Type | Description | Mandatory |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| shops | Object | Object, containing sub-objects with info about on of the partnering shops. | Yes |

**Shops sub-object parameters:**
| Name | Type | Description | Mandatory |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| name | string | Name of the partnering shop. | Yes |
| iconURL | string | Link to shop's logo icon. | Yes |
| deliveryWindow | object | Object, containing info about the closest delivery window. See the table below for full info. | Yes |
| hasFastDelivery | object | Flag that shows if the shop has fast delivery. | Yes |
| deliveryDuration | object | Object, containing info about time for fast delivery. If `hasFastDelivery: false`, this object doesn't display. See the table below for full info. | No |
| link | string |Link to shop's catalogue. | Yes |

**deliveryWindow object parameters:**
| Name | Type | Description | Mandatory |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| startTime | date&time | Start time of the closest delivery window with time zone. Format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS+UTC(as HH:MM)` | Yes |
| endTime | date&time | End time of the closest delivery window with time zone. Format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS+UTC(as HH:MM)` | Yes |

**deliveryDuration object parameters:**
| Name | Type | Description | Mandatory |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| minMinutes | date&time | Minimum duration for fast delivery in minutes. Unix timestamp. | Yes |
| maxMinutes | date&time | Maximum duration for fast delivery in minutes. Unix timestamp. | Yes |

**NOTE:** If there's no shops in the specified city,  the system should return 200 OK and an empty `shops` object.

**Success response example:**
```
HTTP Status Code: 200 OK
{
  "shops": [
    {
      "name": "METRO",
      "iconUrl": "https://domain.tld/images/metroIcon.svg",
      "deliveryWindow": {
        "startTime": "2026-08-26T21:00:00+07:00",
        "endTime": "2026-08-26T23:00:00+07:00"
      },
      "hasFastDelivery": false,
      "url": "https://domain.tld/shops/Moscow/Metro"
    },
    {
      "name": "ВкусВилл",
      "iconUrl": "https://domain.tld/images/VkusVill.svg",
      "deliveryWindow": {
        "startTime": "2026-08-26T21:00:00+07:00",
        "endTime": "2026-08-26T23:00:00+07:00"
      },
      "hasFastDelivery": true,
      "deliveryDuration": {
        "minMinutes": 20,
        "maxMinutes": 60
      },
      "url": "https://domain.tld/shops/Moscow/VkusVill"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Error Response

**Error response parameters:**
| Name | Type | Description | Mandatory |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| HTTP Status Code | number(Integer) | HTTP Status Error code. | Yes |
| code | string | Internal error code. | Yes | 
| message | string | Error message. | Yes |

**Error codes for ShopPartner API:**
| HTTP Status Code | code | message |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 400 | MANDATORY_PARAMETER_MISSING | Mandatory parameters {parameter_name} are missing. |
| 400 | CITY_INVALID | Parameter city is invalid. |
| 404 | CITY_NOT_FOUND | The city {city} doesn't exist. |
| 422 | --- | Invalid JSON. |
| 500 | --- | Internal Server Error |

**Error response example:**
```
HTTP Status Code: 404
{
   "code": "CITY_NOT_FOUND",
   "message": "The city Atlantis doesn't exist"
}
```

